                                    <piko:svg src="@/lib/icons/star.svg" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16"></piko:svg>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                                <p class="review-body">I ate the entire Camembert before the guests arrived. Made another one. Ate that too. Guests arrived to find me on my third Camembert, bread scattered across the kitchen like a crime scene, honey on my elbows. They said it was &ldquo;a lot.&rdquo; They are no longer invited.</p>

                            </div>
